        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "and poor town.Mostof pope were farmer.There were fw facories.The people didnthaveenough food to eat and wore ol cothesThey had a hard life.\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            194,
            558,
            1984,
            913
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Great changes have taken place in the past twenty years.The people have found a lot of ways of making money.Now there are 2many ta buildings.They are very beatiful.Roads are wid and clean. People can take buses or drive their town cars to go to work.Many people have cell phones cand personal computers.People's living conditions have improved a lot.Thanks to the government's efforts.My hometown is becauing more and more beautiful.[译文]在我的家乡发生了很大的变化\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            197,
            934,
            1952,
            1600
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "[译文]在我的家乡发生了很大的变化",
          "block_bbox": [
            210,
            1594,
            1340,
            1675
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "二十多年来，我的家乡只是个又老又穷的小镇。大多数人都是农民。有几个工。人们没有足够的食物吃，把旧衣服穿在身上。他们有一个艰苦的生活。",
          "block_bbox": [
            201,
            1689,
            1967,
            1867
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "在过去的二十年，发生了巨大的变化。人们已经发现很多的赚钱途径。现在有许多高大的建筑物，他们很漂亮。道路宽阔，又干净。人们可以搭公车或驾驶自己的汽车上班。许多人有手机和个人电脑。人民的生活条件有了很大的进步。由于政府的努力，我的家乡正变得越来越美丽。",
          "block_bbox": [
            190,
            1880,
            1963,
            2245
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "number",
